{"title":"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many values of the coefficient <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> do the equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/b/6bb28f2f10e67a77a58cd39fbea334ec67f0484e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}x^2+ax+1=0 \\\\ x^2-x-a=0\\end{align*}\" width=\"123\" height=\"43\" /> have a common real solution?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a397eb7c6a2b831a3e3c953a87b377a6cbfaa66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\infty$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtracting the equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/9/1390db4432a8acd94bf6140b8881f15f4c39ca07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax+x+1+a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"151\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e98a6f6281aa783328bf7c6d6c53a5038d4a1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)(a+1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"146\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, which satisfies the condition. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is nonreal. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817555099cf3c1ef68bd2e5b1f4bd27d48cbbb6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> is the only number that works, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313048c3149436615f6cd06b7f1bec83420d6a37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~alexanderruan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the second equation, isolating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/f/3bfac5b4fedbbd753493ad01250ceaaa038815e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = x^2 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />.  Substituting into the first equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/8/b78a86b3211270ea9c13baa28c09c5152408d8ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+(x^2-x)x+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"182\" height=\"21\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c244707ad87f42b5ed259c3893395dd6433b31f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"16\" />.  The only real root of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/e/86e6a283fa898b7d0c316c3946957207402affca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" />, and substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> reduces both the original equations to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/f/60f09fcd2798430dfe5505397290ccec68b34210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/f/c1f83e7625384ed25d1b54fdd3689a5a2e0d06d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,a)=(-1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" /> is the only real solution to these equations, and thus there is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/2/4c2f45ba306e2fa3a8fbeae63fa939779e2b8a16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" /> value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> such that these equations have a common solution.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME\" title=\"1977 AHSME\">1977 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1977 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1977\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017032136\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 185/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2159/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4355/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.491      1 Template:AHSME_box\n100.00%    7.491      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15186:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017032136 and revision id 284931. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}